When writing or editing documentation or user-facing help text, follow `doc-prerequisites`:

1. Basic overview of the feature.
2. Input validation / prerequisites (required vs optional).
3. If a required item is missing, where to create it — with a link/ref to that section.

Read `~/.cursor/skills/doc-prerequisites/SKILL.md` (or `.cursor/skills/doc-prerequisites/SKILL.md`).
